./ R 00208000          $ 208100 100                                             
*  SYSIPLDV IS WHERE DMKVMI PUTS IT NOW -- XA0011DK -- AND     XA0015DK         
*  WHERE DMKCPI PUTS IT AT 00484000. I-47.                     XA0015DK         
         LH    R0,SYSIPLDV         GET SYS IPL ADDRESS         XA0015DK         
./ R 00269000          $ 269100 100                                             
*  X'B8' WAS FOUR BYTES OF KEY, FLAGS AND DEVICE ADDRESS. IT   XA0015DK         
*  IS NOW THE SUBSYSTEM ID WORD FOLLOWED BY THE INTERRUPTION   XA0015DK         
*  PARAMETER -- EIGHT BYTES -- SO SAVE AND RESTORE BOTH,       XA0015DK         
*  SYMBOLICALLY. I-53.                                         XA0015DK         
         MVC   IOSSID(8),SAVEDEV RESTORE INTERRUPT INFO        XA0015DK         
./ R 00274370 00274520 $ 00274371 001                                           
*  THE COPY INTO THE ARCHITECTED INTERRUPT CODE IS GONE: THE   XA0015DK         
*  VALUE CAME FROM SYSIPLDV ON THE LINE ABOVE AND NOTHING      XA0015DK         
*  READS X'BA' NOW. THE WAIT LOOP KEEPS ITS SHAPE -- BC 7      XA0015DK         
*  MEANS "UNTIL THE DEVICE IS CLEAR", AND XATIO CONSUMES       XA0015DK         
*  STATUS WITH TSCH JUST AS TIO DID, SO THE LOOP STILL         XA0015DK         
*  TERMINATES. *-4 BECOMES A LABEL. R-26.                      XA0015DK         
         XASIO R1                  Issue the read ipl CCW      XA0015DK         
         BC    4,LOADCK            CSW stored; check status    XA0015DK         
         BC    7,IPLLOAD           Error on SIO, wait PSW      XA0015DK         
CKPWT1   XATIO R1                  Loop for i/o completion     XA0015DK         
         BC    7,CKPWT1            Keep trying                 XA0015DK         
./ R 00307000 00312000 $ 00307100 100                                           
*  TIOSYS1 ALREADY LABELS THE FIRST TEST, SO BNZ *-4 ONLY      XA0015DK         
*  NEEDS ITS NAME. R-26.                                       XA0015DK         
         XATIO R2             CLEAR DEVICE                     XA0015DK         
         BNZ   TIOSYS1                                         XA0015DK         
         XASIO R2             START                            XA0015DK         
         BNZ   TIOSYS         CLEAR DEVICE AGAIN               XA0015DK         
CKPWT2   XATIO R2             TEST                             XA0015DK         
         BC    6,CKPWT2       LOOP IF BUSY OR STATUS STORED    XA0015DK         
./ R 00319000          $ 319100 100                                             
SAVESTAT MVC   SAVEDEV(8),IOSSID SAVE INTERRUPT INFORMATION    XA0015DK         
./ R 00323000 00327000 $ 00323100 100                                           
CKPCL3   XATIO R2             CLEAR IT                         XA0015DK         
         BC    6,CKPCL3       LOOP IF BUSY OR STATUS STORED    XA0015DK         
         XASIO R2             START IO (SENSE)                 XA0015DK         
CKPWT3   XATIO R2             TEST IO                          XA0015DK         
         BC    6,CKPWT3       LOOP IF BUSY OR STATUS STORED    XA0015DK         
./ R 00331000 00336000 $ 00331100 100                                           
*  00334000 BRANCHED BACK ONTO THE SIO, NOT ONTO A TEST, SO    XA0015DK         
*  ITS LABEL GOES ON THE XASIO. R-26.                          XA0015DK         
CKPCL4   XATIO R2             DRAIN ANYTHING PENDING           XA0015DK         
         BC    7,CKPCL4       KEEP TRYING                      XA0015DK         
CKPST4   XASIO R2             READ R0                          XA0015DK         
         BC    7,CKPST4       TAKE ERROR PATH                  XA0015DK         
CKPWT4   XATIO R2             TEST FOR COMPLETION              XA0015DK         
         BC    7,CKPWT4       TRY AGAIN                        XA0015DK         
./ R 00684000          $ 684100 100                                             
CKPST5   XASIO R1             SLAM IT TO THE MSC               XA0015DK         
./ R 00685000          $ 685100 100                                             
         BC    2,CKPST5       BUSY, KEEP TRYING...             XA0015DK         
./ R 00690000          $ 690100 100                                             
CKPWT5   XATIO R1             CHECK OUT STATUS                 XA0015DK         
./ R 00691000          $ 691100 100                                             
         BC    2,CKPWT5       BUSY, KEEP TRYING.               XA0015DK         
./ R 00713000          $ 713100 100                                             
         XAHIO R1             HALT IO                          XA0015DK         
./ R 00726000          $ 726100 100                                             
         XAHIO R1             HALT IO                          XA0015DK         
./ R 00772000 00774000 $ 00772100 100                                           
*  THE INTERRUPTING DEVICE ADDRESS COMES FROM THE              XA0015DK         
*  INTERRUPTION PARAMETER NOW, WHICH DMKCPI SET WITH MSCH.     XA0015DK         
*  I-47, XA0013DK.                                             XA0015DK         
         LH    R3,IOINTPRM+2  GET THE INTERRUPTING DEV ADDR    XA0015DK         
CKPST7   XASIO R3             ISSUE SENSE TO IT                XA0015DK         
         BC    2,CKPST7       BETTER NOT BE BUSY               XA0015DK         
./ R 01488000          $ 1488100 100                                            
         XASIO R2             START IO                         XA0015DK         
./ R 01495500          $ 1495510 010                                            
         CH    R2,IOINTPRM+2       RIGHT DEVICE ?              XA0015DK         
./ R 01498000          $ 1498100 100                                            
         MVC   SAVEDEV(8),IOSSID SAVE INTERRUPT INFORMATION    XA0015DK         
./ R 01503000 01507000 $ 01503100 100                                           
CKPCL9   XATIO R2                  CLEAR IT                    XA0015DK         
         BC    6,CKPCL9            LOOP IF BUSY OR STATUS      XA0015DK         
         XASIO R2                  START IO                    XA0015DK         
CKPWT9   XATIO R2                  TEST IO                     XA0015DK         
         BC    6,CKPWT9            LOOP IF BUSY OR STATUS      XA0015DK         
./ R 01511000 01516000 $ 01511100 100                                           
CKPCLA   XATIO R2             DRAIN ANYTHING PENDING           XA0015DK         
         BC    7,CKPCLA       KEEP TRYING                      XA0015DK         
CKPSTA   XASIO R2             READ R0                          XA0015DK         
         BC    7,CKPSTA       TAKE ERROR PATH                  XA0015DK         
CKPWTA   XATIO R2             TEST FOR COMPLETION              XA0015DK         
         BC    7,CKPWTA       TRY AGAIN                        XA0015DK         
./ R 01647000          $ 1647100 100                                            
*  EIGHT BYTES NOW: SUBSYSTEM ID AND INTERRUPTION PARAMETER.   XA0015DK         
*  THIS SITS INSIDE CLR1, WHICH 00541000 ZEROES WITH XC        XA0015DK         
*  CLR1(CLR1SIZE), SO THE REGION GROWS BY FOUR BYTES -- FROM   XA0015DK         
*  ABOUT 136 TO 140, WELL INSIDE THE XC LENGTH LIMIT OF 256.   XA0015DK         
SAVEDEV  DS    2F             ERROR DEVICE: SSID AND PARM      XA0015DK         
./ I 01674000 $ 01674100 100                                                    
*  OUTSIDE EVERY CLEARED REGION ON PURPOSE: CLR1 ENDS ON THE   XA0015DK         
*  LINE ABOVE AND ALLOCBUF BEGINS BELOW, AND BOTH ARE ZEROED   XA0015DK         
*  AT RUNTIME. XAIOWORK HOLDS EXECUTABLE CODE. I-55.           XA0015DK         
         XAIOWORK             XAIO WORK AREAS AND LOOKUP       XA0015DK         
./ I 01723000 $ 01723100 100                                                    
         COPY  XABLOKS                                         XA0015DK         
